    "translations": {
      "en": "Sa'd ibn Abdillah narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad, from al-Abbas ibn Ma'ruf, from Hammad ibn Isa, from Hariz ibn Abdillah, from Zurarah ibn A'yan, from Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him): Regarding a man who issued his fitrah (alms of breaking the fast)."
    }
